{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister is missing and was last seen at the mall where a murder accident... You want to go there, but the mall is closed because of the incident. There's another way through the bunker, so you take the way trough thw bunker. But you quickly realize you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bunker and solve puzzles by carrying items around in boxes or lonesome locations. Complete the game by finding and completing one of the three endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/4dbe7bb2438dc1d3c8e56d3d8454bedb.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/4dbe7bb2438dc1d3c8e56d3d8454bedb.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jacob, the brother of the missing sister. Your goal is to find and rescue her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a bad mood and a flashlight, you make your way through the bunker entrance to the mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.mp4?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the bunker, you encounter the Watcher, who initially talks to you over the loudspeaker. But you ignore him and continue in until he is completely taken over by the virus and tries to kill you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.mp4?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000100?t=1759045317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000100?t=1759045317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/c2e613a6acc197e74ac236eaac73165ff367b9fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759045317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/c2e613a6acc197e74ac236eaac73165ff367b9fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759045317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"its a horror game with much blood and much swearing. the dead scene has blood but dosent show any details like organs \r\nbut through the game you may find some body parts such has hands, heads, random bodys under some cloth with blood on it or random organs\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sister is missing and was last seen at the mall where a murder accident... You want to go there, but the mall is closed because of the incident. There's another way through the bunker, so you take the way trough thw bunker. But you quickly realize you're not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bunker and solve puzzles by carrying items around in boxes or lonesome locations. Complete the game by finding and completing one of the three endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/4dbe7bb2438dc1d3c8e56d3d8454bedb.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/4dbe7bb2438dc1d3c8e56d3d8454bedb.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jacob, the brother of the missing sister. Your goal is to find and rescue her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a bad mood and a flashlight, you make your way through the bunker entrance to the mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/0c260ef7df293280c46a5451558e0d97.mp4?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the bunker, you encounter the Watcher, who initially talks to you over the loudspeaker. But you ignore him and continue in until he is completely taken over by the virus and tries to kill you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.poster.avif?t=1759045317\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.webm?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2fc9263340f0b0caff11e876ed52f2dc.mp4?t=1759045317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Cannedheart's studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/77a33c3e0e5e64278657a6643ea4bc664003a8e2/header.jpg?t=1759045317","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000100/1286674003/d218e1f2727eb26417ca6f2672f952a508edc4da/1756901310/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759045313","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000100/1286674003/d218e1f2727eb26417ca6f2672f952a508edc4da/1756901310/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759045313","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000100/1286674003/d218e1f2727eb26417ca6f2672f952a508edc4da/1756901310/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759045313","id":257192609,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192609/movie480.mp4?t=1759045313","